00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:38.690
So digging deep into what
we often tell customers.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:40.660
In the industry,
we often hear users

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:43.090
saying that they want to
lift and shift to the cloud.

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:46.540
But at Google, we actually
use the term lift and improve.

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:48.580
The reason why I want
to say lift and improve

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:50.621
is because, as you start
using these cloud-native

00:05:50.621 --> 00:05:53.110
technologies, as you start
embracing some of these higher

00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:55.540
