Google Cloud is that we ensure

00:11:22.310 --> 00:11:25.730
that data-- things like pushing
objects to object storage

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:26.880
and things of that sorts--

00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:29.060
are all encrypted
by default. We want

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:32.080
to make sure that
your data is secure,

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:34.840
and we want to make sure
that we're setting you

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:37.660
guys up for success when you
leverage our tools as well

00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:38.956
as our products.

00:11:38.956 --> 00:11:40.330
Another thing is
