00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:42.520
manufacture a lot of our
hardware, and a lot of it

00:11:42.520 --> 00:11:44.570
is purpose built for our needs.

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:46.110
And this leads to
better performance

00:11:46.110 --> 00:11:48.010
as well as reducing
the chance of vendor

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:50.830
in the middle risks, when you're
actually procuring peripherals

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:51.685
from other vendors.

